# Rust build artifacts
/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Emberly session data / project config materialized by `emberly init`
.agents/sessions/
.agents/sessions-*/
# Disposable per-session scratch space (FR-8, T-17) — never committed, and
# this entry is also why glob/grep don't surface scratch content by default
# (both honor .gitignore, Tech Spec §8.3).
.agents/scratch/
# Local dogfooding config (personal provider/model choice). `emberly init`
# treats config.toml as shareable, but this repo's own .agents/config.toml is a
# developer-local artifact and must never be committed.
.agents/config.toml

# Local secrets — never committed (Tech Spec §8)
keys.toml

# Editor / OS cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
